  pack/aws-service/aws-kms-alias             skipped
  pack/aws-service/cdk-bootstrap             skipped
  pack/other-iac/cloudformation              skipped
  pack/other-iac/pulumi                      skipped
  pack/other-iac/crossplane                  skipped
  pack/other-iac/kubernetes                  skipped
  pack/derived/requester-managed-eni         skipped
  pack/derived/autoscaled-instance           skipped
  pack/derived/node-launch-template          skipped
  pack/derived/ecs-task                      skipped
  pack/derived/lambda-edge-replica           skipped
